### Compliance with Requirements

✅ Follows existing `stt_client.go` pattern
✅ Wraps `sttClient` to provide `Transcribe()` method
✅ Handles context cancellation
✅ Returns `TranscriptionResult` with text, confidence, duration, latency
✅ Returns error if service unavailable
✅ Uses retry logic (delegated to client which uses exponential backoff with jitter)
✅ Zeroes audio buffer after transcription (handled by client)
✅ Logs metrics (handled by client)
✅ Returns error if all retries exhausted (handled by client)
✅ Does NOT log sensitive data (handled by client)
✅ Follows TDD principles

